{"version":1,"content":"<p>人工智能編程工具的普及正在改變開源軟件的開發方式，但隨之而來的低質量代碼提交，也給項目維護者帶來了越來越沉重的負擔。Linux內核長期貢獻者、內存管理領域專家Lorenzo Stoakes近日宣佈，將退出多個內核子系統的代碼審查工作，原因正是AI生成的代碼補丁數量激增，已經超出他能夠承擔的審查能力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586212.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:58.070930+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:07:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_hash":"a2187221e21825e7d47aa3f50f2c9fac031e42b95f64718fe40f158154e9b1f8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}